1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
♪ at dusk, in Edge of the Whispering Nebula, Mysterious longing, cautious anticipation.

2
00:00:05,300 --> 00:00:10,300
Lyra: The Whispering Nebula. It... calls to me. A song I've almost forgotten.

3
00:00:10,600 --> 00:00:14,600
Kael: It's beautiful. And dangerous. The currents here are unpredictable.

4
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:19,900
Lyra: But the stories say... truth resides within its heart. A truth I need.

5
00:00:20,200 --> 00:00:24,200
Kael: A heavy truth, perhaps. Like all things worth finding.

6
00:00:25,500 --> 00:00:32,500
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in Deep within the Whispering Nebula, Growing unease, overwhelming nostalgia, dawning suspicion.

7
00:00:32,800 --> 00:00:36,800
Lyra: This shard... it hums. Like a dream just beyond reach.

8
00:00:37,100 --> 00:00:42,100
Kael: Lyra, wait. The raw souvenirs here can be overwhelming. They can consume you.

9
00:00:42,400 --> 00:00:48,400
Lyra: non, this isn't just a mémoire. It feels like *mine*. A piece of a forgotten self.

10
00:00:48,700 --> 00:00:50,700
Lyra: Loss... so much loss...

11
00:00:50,1000 --> 00:00:54,1000
Kael: Pull back! Now. You don't know what you're stirring.

12
00:00:56,300 --> 00:01:04,300
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in A clearing within the nebula, near a dark vortex, Clear threat, growing suspicion, dread.

13
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:08,600
Lyra: This is le silence's work. It leaves nothing behind.

14
00:01:08,900 --> 00:01:12,900
Kael: It is. I've... seen its touch before. Closer than you know.

15
00:01:13,200 --> 00:01:19,200
Lyra: Closer? What aren't you telling me, Kael? Your peur isn't just for me, is it?

16
00:01:19,500 --> 00:01:24,500
Kael: My peur is for what we might awaken. For what *you* might awaken.

17
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:33,800
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in The core chamber of the Whispering Nebula, Tense anticipation, sudden terror, overwhelming presence.

18
00:01:34,100 --> 00:01:39,100
Lyra: There. The core shard. It pulses with a lumière I haven't seen since...

19
00:01:39,400 --> 00:01:42,400
Kael: Something's stirring. The air... it's growing cold.

20
00:01:42,700 --> 00:01:45,700
Lyra: We're close. The answers are within reach.

21
00:01:45,1000 --> 00:01:51,1000
Kael: Not answers. A presence. It knows we're here. Lyra, we need to be ready.

22
00:01:53,300 --> 00:01:59,300
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in Hero's mindscape / The core chamber, Profound grief, despair, vulnerability.

23
00:01:59,600 --> 00:02:04,600
Lyra: non... not this. The emptiness... the echo of a name je ne peux pas remember.

24
00:02:04,900 --> 00:02:07,900
Lyra: It's all gone. There's nothing left but dust.

25
00:02:08,200 --> 00:02:09,200
Lyra: Oblivion... peace...

26
00:02:09,500 --> 00:02:12,500
Kael: Lyra! Fight it! Don't let it take you!

27
00:02:13,800 --> 00:02:19,800
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in The core chamber, Desperate action, partial revelation, dawning suspicion.

28
00:02:20,100 --> 00:02:22,100
Kael: You will not have her!

29
00:02:22,400 --> 00:02:24,400
Lyra: Kael... what was that?

30
00:02:24,700 --> 00:02:28,700
Kael: A... a trick. An old ward. It won't hold long.

31
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in The core chamber, Silence temporarily repelled, Suspicion, distrust, forced calm.

32
00:02:36,300 --> 00:02:43,300
Lyra: An old ward? I've jamais seen anything like it. And that lumière... it wasn't just a trick.

33
00:02:43,600 --> 00:02:45,600
Lyra: Who are you, really, Kael?

34
00:02:45,900 --> 00:02:50,900
Kael: Je suis your companion. Je suis here to help you find your truth.

35
00:02:51,200 --> 00:03:05,200
Lyra: And what truth do you hide from me? What power have you kept secret? We came here for honesty, Kael. Don't tell me you're a part of the very thing we seek to understand.

36
00:03:05,500 --> 00:03:11,500
Kael: I swear to you, Je suis not. But my past... it complicates things. Profoundly.

37
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:17,800
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in The core chamber, Desperate resolve, lingering tension.

38
00:03:18,100 --> 00:03:24,100
Lyra: Complications or not, nous sommes here. The answers are in that shard. We retrieve it. Now.

39
00:03:24,400 --> 00:03:29,400
Kael: Agreed. Whatever secrets it holds, we face them together. Before le silence returns.

40
00:03:29,700 --> 00:03:35,700
Lyra: It will return. It toujours does. But not before we have what we came for.

41
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:44,000
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in A temporary shielded pocket within the nebula, Shock, despair, betrayal, shattering truth.

42
00:03:44,300 --> 00:03:53,300
Lyra: non... it can't be. le silence... it's not a force. It's a wound. My wound. A consequence of my own forgotten grief.

43
00:03:53,600 --> 00:03:55,600
Lyra: And you... Kael... you knew.

44
00:03:55,900 --> 00:04:03,900
Kael: I did. I was there. I witnessed it all. I swore to protect you from this truth, to keep it buried.

45
00:04:04,200 --> 00:04:11,200
Lyra: You didn't protect me. You lied. You let me walk into this... this echo of my own destruction.

46
00:04:12,500 --> 00:04:20,500
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in The nebula, under direct assault by le silence, Overwhelming terror, cosmic destruction, desperate flight.

47
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:23,800
Kael: It's reacting! The nebula... it's tearing itself apart!

48
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:29,100
Lyra: My grief... it feeds it. la vérité has only made it stronger.

49
00:04:29,400 --> 00:04:34,400
Kael: We have to go! Now! This place is collapsing. It's consuming everything!

50
00:04:34,700 --> 00:04:37,700
Lyra: Run? Where? It follows me. It *is* me.

51
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:43,000
Kael: We run to understand! To find a way to mend what was broken!

52
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:52,300
♪ under the cover of obscurité, in Drifting in the void, near the consumed nebula, Profound loss, despair, fractured bond, bleak uncertainty.

53
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:59,600
Lyra: All that hope... gone. Replaced by a truth that devours worlds. And you... you knew the cost.

54
00:04:59,900 --> 00:05:06,900
Kael: I believed it was the only way. To spare you the burden. I was wrong. Terribly wrong.

55
00:05:07,200 --> 00:05:15,200
Lyra: How can I confiance you? How can I confiance myself, when my very existence is a catalyst for such destruction?

56
00:05:15,500 --> 00:05:26,500
Kael: confiance is shattered. I know. But the journey isn't over. We carry this truth now. Both of us. And perhaps... that shared weight is the only path forward.

57
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:29,800
Lyra: A path of ashes. And broken promises.
